    "description": "The Vega Boolean is a premium flip up (modular) helmet that combines the convenience of an open-face helmet with the protection of a full-face shell. Its smooth chin bar mechanism lifts up easily for hands-free conversations or quick visor cleaning, making it ideal for daily commuters and touring riders. The helmet features a bold red, black, and white color scheme with sharp graphic lines and \"BOOLEAN\" branding, along with the signature \"Vega\" logo on the front and a \"SHADOW\" wordmark at the rear. An aerodynamic rear spoiler adds to its sporty profile while improving high-speed stability Practical features include a Dual Visor System with a clear outer visor and a retractable smoke inner sun visor for instant glare protection, multi-point ventilation for continuous airflow and anti-fogging, a quick-release \"PUSH\" visor lock mechanism, and a removable, washable interior liner for all-day comfort and hygiene. Safety is fully certified \u2014 the Vega Boolean is DOT certified (FMVSS No. 218) and ISI certified (IS:4151), confirming it meets recognized standards for impact absorption, penetration resistance, and retention strength. It's a helmet that delivers modular versatility, everyday comfort, and dependable, certified protection in one sporty package."
